    "text": "<p>For any real numbers&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>, let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, be the solution of the differential equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then which of the following functions belong(s) to the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>?</p>",
